# are applied/cleared by openPanel()/closePanel() so the desktop sidebar
# presentation is never "a dialog"), so the moved markup this mutant carries
# dropped the same two attributes to stay byte-identical to the real
# element. The mutation itself - moving the block into <header> - is
# unchanged.
# Refreshed 2026-09-29 (lane S2): the panel's Practice group now ships a
# third #modeS button and a conditional #panel-seq-note credit/link
# paragraph inside the same panel-group; this mutant's moved copy carries
# both so it stays byte-identical to the real element, exactly as it
